/**
 * Two variants exist wherever the API distinguishes them:
 *
 *   `Landlord`       — a response. `writeOnly` fields (ID numbers, payout
 *                     details, security notes) are absent, because the server
 *                     never returns them.
 *   `LandlordInput`  — a request. `readOnly` fields (verification status,
 *                     counters, timestamps) are absent, because the server
 *                     owns them.
 *
 * Where a schema has neither, only the plain name is emitted.
 */

